     "WEF_E93E134D6F0E444193C858E4EBFCBAD6_Kanban.Column.Done": false,
     "System.Description": "<div><b>Info Requested</b> </div><div>* - Indicates a required field </div><div><ul><li>Company Name * </li><li>Person's Name * </li><ul><li>First &amp; Last </li> </ul><li>Business Address * </li><ul><li>Street </li><li>City </li><li>Province (CAD) / State (US) [Dropdown]<br> </li><li>Country [Dropdown] </li><li>Postal / Zip </li> </ul><li>Bank Name* </li><li>Account Number * </li><li>Routing or Transit Number (3-digit Institution Code and 5-digit Branch Code) * </li><ul><li>Can this have data validation attached to the field that verifies it's a legitimate routing or transit number? </li> </ul><li>Checking or Savings Account * </li><ul><li>Single Selection field </li> </ul><li>Personal or Business Account * </li><ul><li>Single Selection field </li> </ul><li>Point of Contact Email * </li><ul><li>Data validation to verify it's an email address </li> </ul><li>Accounting Email * </li><ul><li>Data validation to verify it's an email address </li> </ul><li>Phone Number </li><ul><li>Formatted +# (###) ###-#### </li> </ul><li>Attachments * </li><ul><li>Invoices and a W9 attachments are required </li><ul><li>The user should be able to select whether an attachment is an 'Invoice', 'W9', or 'Miscellaneous' </li> </ul><li>Other forms or information may be optional </li> </ul><li>Invoice Information </li><ul><li>NOTE: Can we use OCR, AI, or something to scan and pre-populate invoice information based on an invoice they attached? </li><ul><li>The user should be asked to confirm that the prepopulated information is correct </li><li>We may need to do this for multiple invoices if they're uploading multiple. For this, we should provide an aggregated total amount </li><ul><li>This could be through multiple attachments, and the attachment could have one or multiple invoices within it. </li> </ul> </ul><li>Company Name </li><li>Invoice Number </li><li>Invoice Date </li><li>Subtotal </li><li>Tax </li><li>Total </li><li>Aggregated Total </li><li>Currency </li> </ul> </ul><div> </div><div><br> </div><div>See attachments for example </div><div><br> </div> </div><div><b>Form Tools</b> </div><div><ul><li>Submit button </li><ul><li>Feedback on the submittal &amp; advise next steps. Should send an email to the address listed on the form. </li> </ul><li>Attachments button </li> </ul> </div>"
    },
